### ⚠️ Test Suite Blockage: Need to allow SELECT policy on learning_question_analysis_snapshots

This assertion prevents any policies from being created on learning_question_analysis_snapshots. However, because learning_question_registry_projection is a security_invoker view, it requires a SELECT policy on learning_question_analysis_snapshots so that authenticated users can read the global question metadata. Otherwise, all snapshot columns will return NULL for learners.

Please remove learning_question_analysis_snapshots from this list and add a test assertion verifying that a SELECT policy exists for it.

```suggestion
    [
      'learning_reconciliation_runs',
      'learning_question_events',
    ].forEach((table) => {
      expect(sql).not.toMatch(
        new RegExp('create policy [^\\n]+ on public\\.' + table + ' .* to (anon|authenticated|public)'),
      );
    });

    expect(sql).toContain('create policy learning_question_analysis_snapshots_select_all on public.learning_question_analysis_snapshots for select to authenticated using (question_id is not null)');
```

